	(text "R23/R27 calculations:\n\nCoil/valve current: 0.19 A \n*We don't know forward voltage, \ncurrent - limited information on \nproduct page. *\n\nFormula 1)\nR=(V supply)/Coil/valve current = \n12V/0.19A = 63.157 ohms\n\nR=63.157 ohms. \n\nWe can round to 100 ohms to \nsave power"
